default-router 12.1.127.254
network 12.1.0.0 255.255.128.0
ip dhcp pool vlan5
default-router 12.2.255.254
network 12.2.0.0 255.255.0.0


Router ospf 1
network 12.1.0.0 0.0.127.255 area 0
network 12.2.0.0 0.0.255.255 area 0
network 12.0.0.12 0.0.0.3 area 0
network 12.0.0.16 0.0.0.3 area 0
network 12.0.0.20 0.0.0.3 area 0


